{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to find a HDD which can be found in the radar station commandant's office on Lighthouse. A Radar station commandant room key is needed to enter it. The radar station is located at the lighthouse peninsula territory. The commandant's office is located on the first floor, recognizable by a red sign. The HDD is located on a desk in the back of the room.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/3/30/RadarStationMap.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20250504000733","c":"Radar station marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/1/1b/RadarStation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20220702203823","c":"The radar station"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/c/cb/CommandersOffice.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260325235930","c":"The way to the office"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/c/c3/CommandersOfficeClose.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260325235847","c":"The wanted office"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/ae/Top_Secret_Table.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260326000248","c":"The table with the hard drive"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/4/4a/Top_Secret_HDD.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260326000342","c":"The wanted hard drive"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}